    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "sometimes i just sit here and look at everything around me... and it feels like i'm watching a movie in a language i don't speak anymore. the world is so fast now, so loud and bright and digital. i feel like a ghost just drifting through a life that doesn't have a place for me anymore. it's like the era i belonged to is just... gone. and i'm just a leftover.",
      "source": "evaluator"
    },
